0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기아자동차</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">와 한국사회복지협의회는 교통사고로 피해를 입은 세대의 유자녀에게 장학금을 통해 학업을 지원하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">본 사업 지원 대상에 해당되는 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교통사고 유자녀 장학금 지원사업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">」 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 안내문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">을 필독하셔서 기한까지 장학금 신청서류를 접수하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대 상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">:</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">자동차 교통사고로 인하여 사망 혹은 중증후유장애</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(1~4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 입은 자의 유자녀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학교 재학중이여 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">접수기한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2015.12.07(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ~ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2016.01.22.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">도착분까지</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; m